# Repo-wide packaging rules.
#
# What ships is controlled by the `files` field in package.json. Ignore rules
# only filter inside the directories that the whitelist lets through.
#
# Webapp-specific build output rules live in apps/webapp/.npmignore, which also
# exists so that apps/webapp/.gitignore (`/.next/`) cannot drop the packaged
# `.next/server`, `.next/static`, and `.next/BUILD_ID` entries again.

# Exclude source maps from the published package (not needed at runtime).
**/*.map

node_modules
